  "source_basis": "No retained producer answer sits in the repo: ycharts/extract/fixtures/synthetic_pdf holds three synthetic PDFs (overview, comparison, multicomp) and a MANIFEST, no answer JSON with section_id values; the portal fixtures were not found to carry S18 ids (Grep for S18. under portal/src/pages/InvestorReporting: 0 files). So the ids are produced by applying extract.py :704-707 to the S18 fields of the census, two entity columns.",
